# ============================================================================
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
# ============================================================================
# 
# 1. Go to Firebase Console: https://console.firebase.google.com
# 2. Select your project or create a new one
# 3. Click Settings icon (⚙️) → Project Settings
# 4. Scroll to "Your apps" section
# 5. Find your Web app and click it
# 6. Copy the config object (should contain: apiKey, authDomain, projectId, etc)
# 7. Replace the placeholder values above with your REAL credentials
# 8. Make sure Authentication is enabled in Firebase Console
# 9. Make sure Firestore Database is created (start in test mode)
# 10. Restart dev server: pnpm dev
# 
# ============================================================================